		<p>The <term translate="no">A/C</term> refrigerant label in the vehicle may differ from the illustration.</p>
		<p>Each symbol and specification on the <term translate="no">A/C</term> refrigerant label is represented below:</p>
		<ol outputclass="callout" id="e02008">
			<li>
				<p>Caution</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Classification of refrigerant</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Classification of compressor lubricant</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Flammable refrigerant</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Requires a registered technician to service the <term translate="no">A/C</term> system</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Amount of refrigerant</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>CO <sub>2</sub> equivalent of refrigerant</p>
			</li>
		</ol>
		<p>The refrigerant label is located underneath the hood.</p>
